  "sourceTitle": "Leek Soup",
  "sourceText": "Leek Soup\nBy: Laura Jill\nPublished: Wednesday, December 16, 2009 - 12:13am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 stalk leeks, sliced\nmushrooms, optional\n3 tablespoons butter\n3 cups beef broth to thicken\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook leeks and mushrooms (optional) in butter until soft. Add broth and simmer until hot. Thicken with flour. Serve\n\nComments:\nLaura Jill\n\nThis recipe can easily be veganized...I just added a widget to my post that contains my recipe.  Enjoy!",
